{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026heZN9iyOFf1795790499.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>康文署接獲外判承辦商通報，指發現康體通被黑客非法進入。</p><p></p><p>包括黑客非法進入康體通中「重新啟動LEISURE LINK帳戶」功能，涉及約9萬名LEISURE LINK帳戶的個人資料，包括出生日期、電話號碼、地址、性別及電郵地址，以及其中約1,500名用戶的姓名，但不涉身份證明文件資料，康體通亦沒有儲存任何信用卡或其他付款資料。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SMARTPLAY-2000_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026DfUJtEoLI81795790539.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>另外，忘記用戶編號或密碼功能，亦被黑客非法使用，以至系統向用戶發出載有驗證碼的電郵，目前康體通已取消「重新啟動LEISURE LINK帳戶」功能，並將全面移除LEISURE LINK的資料，亦已停止忘記用戶編號或密碼功能，用戶如需更改密碼，可攜帶身份證到智能自助服務站，或康樂事務辦事處辦理。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T16:04:09.013652+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":309,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T14:24:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T09:09:49.191523+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T15:57:16.376355+00:00","content_hash":"f17f70f8c9f6f5425829ed8ca5604b850a34c1242282c8af9e366db573a63376","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T16:04:09.013652+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}